> Interpretation and limits

Negative/nonfinite weights, invalid endpoints and adjacency shape mismatches
throw even if the malformed edge is beyond the goal. Finite path-sum overflow
also throws. found=false distinguishes unreachable from a valid zero-cost path.
The plot compares two executed searches, rather than relabelling n as measured
full Dijkstra work.

The complete editable C++ programs save figures locally; results contain
ordinary computed Markdown. Selected counters describe actual producer
operations, excluding validation when stated.

